cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the paper and the archived
  release.
title: >-
  Code and figures for "Well-posedness, Stability, and Bifurcation in an
  Acid-Mediated Tumour Invasion Model with Interspecific Competition"
abstract: >-
  Solver, symbolic verifications and figure generators for a three-component
  reaction-diffusion model of acid-mediated tumour invasion with interspecific
  competition: IMEX scheme with a ghost-node Neumann Laplacian, bifurcation
  and stability analysis, bisection campaign for the critical seed radius, and
  Fisher-KPP front-speed measurement.
type: software
